	(text "U46: PS_MGTRAVCC 0.85 V LDO (Rev C item 9). PMIC BUCK4 (0.90 V OTP, above the 0.876 V max) no longer feeds PS_MGTRAVCC;\nit runs unloaded as +0V9_BUCK4. Vout = 0.8 V x (1 + 619/10k) = 0.8495 V. VIN +1V8 (DS925 FPD step 2 with VCC_PSDDR_PLL), BIAS +3V3.\nUG583: < 10 mVpp noise, dedicated rail, 10 uF at the balls (C161)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 23.876 316.484 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6859fa8f-eb40-4af6-820a-124fb9b6d7d5")
	)
	(text "USB2 upstream HS probe points (Rev B D10/D13).\nTP3 = GND for the probe ground spring;\nplace TP1-TP3 within a few mm of U5 pins 45/46."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 423.926 153.162 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bfa8221b-c4d9-4a26-a2d2-f05cedca1cf1")
	)
	(text "Rev C USB (2026-11-14): copy of AMD Kria KR260 carrier sheet 24 (USB0 PHY and hub), docs/reference/kr260.\nDeviations: VDDIO 3.3 V (MIO bank 502), all four downstream ports enabled (no PRT_DIS straps), hub SMBus on I2C0 (RTC bus),\nAP2171W (1 A) per port (EN+FLG tied to PRT_CTLn, combined mode) instead of MP62341, 1.8 V from local LDO U45.\nResets: USB_PHY_RESET_B = MIO64, USB_HUB_RESET_B = MIO65 (10k pull-ups, released by default).\nCrystals: 18 pF load parts with KR260 cap values. Rev B used a 12 pF crystal on 22 pF caps (fault D10-D13)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 29.21 303.784 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bfd458eb-fb93-4401-ba10-13d37e54f5d0")
	)
	(text "HCSL: R231/R232 initially 0R (DS20005870B Fig. 5-1).\n49.9R shunts precede the existing 10nF AC coupling."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 125.73 90.17 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dc4caceb-a395-4f1e-90b5-1ae495b689b2")
	)
